This is an excellent place to start. Fixing this Thread Starvation Deadlock will immediately stabilize your batch processing and prevent the entire application from freezing under load.
To fix this, we are going to implement a **Coordinator-Worker pattern**.
 1. bulkExecutor will remain the **Coordinator** (handling the top-level @Async tasks).
 2. A new chunkWorkerExecutor will act as the **Worker** (processing the inner CompletableFuture chunks).
